<item><title>Ethiopia&apos;s digital payments reach ETB 33 trillion in 2025/26</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/et/ethiopia-s-digital-payments-reach-etb-33-trillion-in-2025-26-aec861/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/et/ethiopia-s-digital-payments-reach-etb-33-trillion-in-2025-26-aec861/</guid><category>Ethiopia</category><description>The National Bank of Ethiopia reported 157.6 million mobile money accounts by June 2026 as digital finance expands across the country.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 07:56:55 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/et/ethiopia-s-digital-payments-reach-etb-33-trillion-in-2025-26-aec861/share.jpg" length="42100" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/et/ethiopia-s-digital-payments-reach-etb-33-trillion-in-2025-26-aec861/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
